-/// **R3.5c: ONE PREFIX, ALL 48 LAYERS, BACK TO BACK.**  `k` in 1..5 replays `preP[k-1][l]` (or `execs[l]` for
-/// k = 5) for every layer with no other graph in between, and reports the whole sweep in milliseconds.
