-//   * XOR, not sum.  Two equal tokens with equal multipliers cancel to zero under XOR and double under sum.
-//   * `%` vocab_size, not `& (vocab_size-1)`.  The vocab sizes are 20000003, 20000023, 20000033, ... - not
